    "notes": [
      "Full-bleed meadow beyond rules rectangle; no rectangular dark vignette or 360-degree uniform tree wall.",
      "The seven terrain woodland regions read as five broad peripheral masses plus two small separating copses; gaps and depth vary.",
      "Draw hills as coherent connected crowns plus edge faces; do not stack a full cliff/pillar once per mountain cell and then add authored cliffs again.",
      "Tall trees belong at region lobes with low understory between; keep random decals sparse in tactical pockets.",
      "Scene props use existing registered sprite anchors/presentationScale once. These anchors are a starting point requiring actual BoardView screenshot QA, not a claim of pixel clearance.",
      "Ramps must visually agree with high-to-low cells; north southeast ramp meets h(10,5)/(10,6); east ramp meets h(21,11)/(22,12)."
    ]
  },
